# D-105 native (the author's Q39, 2026-09-27; steps/d105-native.md §4): the text of
# unit_walk_d105_perm.lm2 without --walk-methods.  `rd` and `wr` stay native: the walked root admits
# `o: Other` by name (lmx_walk_admit_as, its record in the arena's implements table), and the native
# callees read and write the marked formal's fields at the slot the record gives.  Slice 1 refused this
# call: "an admission to a Structure type".  Success is 7.
Model:
    size_t: a 1U
    size_t: b 2U
end: Model
Other:
    size_t: b 20U
    size_t: a 10U
end: Other
fn: rd (Model: m) size_t
return: m\a
fn: wr (Model: m; size_t: v) size_t
    m\a: v
    return: m\b
o: merge: Other
mm: merge: Model
size_t: got 0U
int: ok 7
got: rd(o)
if: got != 10U
    ok: 1
got: rd(mm)
if: got != 1U
    ok: 2
got: wr(o 11U)
if: got != 20U
    ok: 3
if: o\a != 11U
    ok: 4
if: o\b != 20U
    ok: 5
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: ok; stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
